          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwafika kuye umuntu olobulephero, waguqa ngamadolo phambi kwakhe, emncenga esithi kuye: Aluba uthanda, ungangihlambulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu wamhawukela, welula isandla sakhe, wamthinta, wathi: Ngiyathanda; hlambuluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahle basuka ubulephero kuye, wahlambuluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamlayisisa, wamyekela wahamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "esithi kuye: Khangela, ungatsheli muntu, kodwa hamba uziveze kumpristi, unikele okokuhlanjululwa kwakho lokho okwalayelwa nguMose, kube yibufakazi ebantwini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
